# Expo-first dependencies

Canonical policy: [docs/guides/expo-first-dependencies.md](../../docs/guides/expo-first-dependencies.md).

## Quick rules

- Prefer **Expo-maintained** modules (`expo-*`) when Expo covers the need; install with **`npx expo install`**.
- **Navigation:** Expo recommends **Expo Router** for Expo apps. This repo uses React Navigation today — **do not** migrate without a ticket; **do not** add a second navigation library; prefer Expo Router only when a ticket asks for new nav architecture.
- After native/Expo bumps: `npm run doctor` (and `npx expo install --fix` if needed).
- Query **Expo MCP** before inventing APIs ([expo-mcp.mdc](./expo-mcp.mdc)). Android-only forever ([android-only.mdc](./android-only.mdc)).
